WEBVTT

00:30.764 --> 00:34.314
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:34.334 --> 00:37.714
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:37.984 --> 00:43.954
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.114 --> 00:48.744
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:48.764 --> 00:52.274
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:52.294 --> 00:55.784
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:55.804 --> 00:59.314
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

00:59.334 --> 01:05.394
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:18.654 --> 01:22.934
Si Jin

01:22.954 --> 01:26.934
Episode 5

01:27.016 --> 01:28.096
It's too dangerous here.

01:28.096 --> 01:29.606
I'll take you home now

01:29.626 --> 01:32.106
and report it to the Capital Security.

01:32.186 --> 01:33.276
Yu Qi!

01:33.296 --> 01:34.866
I've found the witness.

01:34.866 --> 01:36.406
That's the crime scene.

01:36.426 --> 01:38.296
If I bring my men here,

01:38.296 --> 01:39.426
we'll find the evidence.

01:39.426 --> 01:40.606
It won't work.

01:40.626 --> 01:42.136
You have to be well prepared,

01:42.136 --> 01:44.066
or the evidence will be eliminated

01:44.066 --> 01:45.296
and the witnesses will disappear.

01:45.296 --> 01:47.116
Have you done something already?

01:47.136 --> 01:48.296
Anyway, you have to trust me.

01:48.296 --> 01:49.476
I can't leave, really.

01:49.496 --> 01:50.426
Marquis Changxing's Mansion

01:50.426 --> 01:52.076
is no ordinary place.

01:52.096 --> 01:54.526
You must plan the whole thing carefully.

01:54.546 --> 01:56.216
You can't be impulsive.

02:03.096 --> 02:04.456
What's wrong?

02:04.746 --> 02:06.296
Are you always like this?

02:06.586 --> 02:07.536
Like what?

02:07.536 --> 02:08.896
So annoying.

02:10.186 --> 02:13.056
But I can't be mad at you right now.

02:13.346 --> 02:15.056
You have a point.

02:15.256 --> 02:17.286
I didn't think it through.

02:17.306 --> 02:19.626
But I just got you out of there.

02:19.626 --> 02:20.946
I can't just stand by

02:20.946 --> 02:22.846
and watch you take a risk.

02:22.866 --> 02:24.346
It requires strategy and tactics

02:24.346 --> 02:25.786
to fight a war.

02:25.786 --> 02:27.826
You can't just clash head-on.

02:28.466 --> 02:29.896
How about this?

02:30.536 --> 02:31.726
Let's work together

02:31.746 --> 02:33.476
to bring this villain to justice

02:33.496 --> 02:35.616
and avenge the deaths of those women.

02:35.656 --> 02:37.296
Can you trust me?

02:41.066 --> 02:43.546
Yes, I trust you.

02:44.586 --> 02:46.046
Take care of yourself.

02:46.066 --> 02:47.456
I'll be back as soon as I can.

02:53.096 --> 02:54.326
(I know)

02:54.346 --> 02:55.216
(you approached me)

02:55.216 --> 02:56.736
(with an agenda, )

02:56.936 --> 02:58.516
(but I believe)

02:58.536 --> 03:00.666
(you're a good official for the job.)

03:08.026 --> 03:09.146
Make sure

03:09.146 --> 03:10.986
she isn't in any danger.

03:11.646 --> 03:17.486
(Marquis Changxing's Mansion)

03:17.486 --> 03:21.646
(Blessings from Heaven)

03:22.536 --> 03:24.616
This is Miss Si, right?

03:26.376 --> 03:28.026
I remember when Xingyu got married,

03:28.026 --> 03:29.886
you were still young.

03:29.906 --> 03:31.666
But I could tell

03:31.666 --> 03:33.576
you were going to be a beauty.

03:33.936 --> 03:35.516
I didn't expect that you've

03:35.536 --> 03:38.286
(Marquis Changxing's wife)
become so beautiful.

03:38.306 --> 03:39.956
I'm flattered, Ma'am.

03:39.976 --> 03:42.956
Looks are a gift from my parents.

03:42.976 --> 03:44.946
It has nothing to do with my efforts.

03:45.186 --> 03:47.056
I don't think

03:47.146 --> 03:48.786
it's worth mentioning.

03:49.286 --> 03:51.416
It's surprising that you're so insightful

03:51.416 --> 03:53.336
despite your young age.

03:54.216 --> 03:57.176
I like her from the bottom of my heart.

03:57.216 --> 03:58.496
Mother, if you don't mind

03:58.496 --> 04:00.356
my sisters disturbing you,

04:00.376 --> 04:02.826
let them stay with you for a few more days.

04:03.946 --> 04:05.376
Good idea.

04:06.616 --> 04:09.176
Greetings, Mother.

04:15.146 --> 04:16.666
Sit down.

04:16.906 --> 04:18.266
Xingyu,

04:18.296 --> 04:20.346
why do you look so tired?

04:20.826 --> 04:22.136
Did your father punish you by making you

04:22.136 --> 04:23.816
practice swordsmanship last night?

04:24.386 --> 04:25.826
Father is hard on me

04:25.826 --> 04:27.546
for my own good.

04:27.826 --> 04:29.186
By the way,

04:29.346 --> 04:30.616
did you girls

04:30.616 --> 04:33.226
sleep well last night?

04:38.536 --> 04:39.896
We did.

04:40.346 --> 04:41.766
Good for you.

04:41.786 --> 04:43.386
Qian cares about us very much.

04:43.386 --> 04:45.446
And you are so kind, Ma'am.

04:45.466 --> 04:46.786
I feel

04:46.786 --> 04:49.226
more comfortable here than at home.

04:50.946 --> 04:52.736
I didn't

04:53.176 --> 04:54.666
sleep well.

05:02.296 --> 05:03.516
I'm picky about the bed.

05:03.536 --> 05:04.896
Really?

05:04.976 --> 05:07.016
You're so pampered, Si.

05:07.036 --> 05:08.276
Isn't the bed at the Marquis's mansion

05:08.276 --> 05:10.036
better than that at the Earl's mansion?

05:11.326 --> 05:12.906
I'll see what I can do

05:12.926 --> 05:14.766
for your bed tonight.

05:16.966 --> 05:19.686
So, help yourselves, girls.

05:19.926 --> 05:21.106
Mother,

05:21.126 --> 05:23.166
I'm leaving.

05:53.046 --> 05:54.566
Miss Si,

05:55.846 --> 05:57.346
we didn't say anything.

05:57.366 --> 05:58.286
Neither did Anzi.

05:58.286 --> 05:59.186
Young Master...

05:59.206 --> 06:00.726
Don't be afraid.

06:00.766 --> 06:02.686
I wasn't going to turn you in.

06:02.726 --> 06:03.946
And I know

06:03.966 --> 06:05.406
you're more tenderhearted than Anzi.

06:05.406 --> 06:06.546
You're kind.

06:06.566 --> 06:07.766
You didn't put much effort

06:07.766 --> 06:09.886
into strangling me last night.

06:10.006 --> 06:11.466
So I think

06:11.486 --> 06:13.426
you've long been reluctant

06:13.446 --> 06:15.606
to do such outrageous things, right?

06:15.806 --> 06:17.306
I have no choice.

06:17.326 --> 06:19.026
I'm just a servant.

06:19.046 --> 06:20.666
I have to do whatever

06:20.686 --> 06:22.166
Young Master tells me to do.

06:25.806 --> 06:27.466
But have you ever thought

06:27.486 --> 06:29.706
that with his temperament,

06:29.726 --> 06:31.886
how long he will let you live

06:32.046 --> 06:34.046
if you know such a secret about him?

06:37.326 --> 06:38.706
What should I do then?

06:38.726 --> 06:41.046
Miss Si, can you help me?

06:41.166 --> 06:42.286
I can,

06:42.286 --> 06:43.786
but you must tell me something.

06:43.806 --> 06:45.036
Last night I heard you say

06:45.036 --> 06:46.406
there was another girl being held captive,

06:46.406 --> 06:47.666
- right?
- Yes.

06:47.686 --> 06:48.826
You should tell me

06:48.846 --> 06:50.406
where she's being held.

06:52.206 --> 06:53.966
This is Niuniu's.

06:54.406 --> 06:55.326
Take a good look at it.

06:55.326 --> 06:56.786
Don't make a mistake.

06:56.806 --> 06:58.906
I bought her the hairpin.

06:58.926 --> 07:00.786
How could I be wrong?

07:00.806 --> 07:02.326
Where is Niuniu?

07:05.046 --> 07:06.606
Where is she?

07:19.846 --> 07:22.046
Don't be scared when you get in.

07:49.886 --> 07:51.246
Miss.

07:59.046 --> 08:02.826
(Modest Gentleman)

08:02.846 --> 08:05.686
(The Map of Ling'an)

08:06.166 --> 08:07.036
In the past five years,

08:07.036 --> 08:08.246
(Missing cases in Ling'an)
in Ling'an,

08:08.246 --> 08:09.446
there have been 15 cases

08:09.446 --> 08:10.746
of missing women.

08:10.766 --> 08:11.846
How can you conclude

08:11.846 --> 08:13.206
that they are all done by the same suspect

08:13.206 --> 08:14.586
and are serial crimes?

08:14.606 --> 08:16.326
Isn't that a bit arbitrary?

08:25.806 --> 08:27.926
These missing women

08:28.046 --> 08:30.226
are between 16 and 20,

08:30.246 --> 08:31.586
all pretty

08:31.606 --> 08:33.406
and from modest families

08:33.406 --> 08:34.986
or merchants.

08:35.006 --> 08:37.466
Long Dan and I discovered

08:37.486 --> 08:39.626
that the last place they appeared

08:39.646 --> 08:41.646
(White Tiger Bridge)
was here.

08:42.526 --> 08:44.186
Marquis Changxing's Mansion?

08:44.206 --> 08:47.066
These are the clues we've gathered.

08:47.086 --> 08:48.286
Basically, the testimonies

08:48.286 --> 08:49.486
all point

08:49.486 --> 08:50.746
to the same man,

08:50.766 --> 08:52.166
Cao Xingyu.

08:54.766 --> 08:56.126
Mr. Zhen,

08:56.686 --> 08:59.406
do you still think I'm being arbitrary?

08:59.526 --> 09:01.286
There is indeed something suspicious,

09:01.486 --> 09:03.446
but after all, this is just conjecture.

09:03.446 --> 09:04.586
Without solid evidence,

09:04.606 --> 09:06.466
we can't combine the cases.

09:06.486 --> 09:07.846
Ok.

09:08.366 --> 09:10.006
I have other evidence.

09:10.326 --> 09:11.926
There's another missing woman

09:11.926 --> 09:13.326
named Niuniu.

09:13.726 --> 09:15.226
Her hairpin was found

09:15.246 --> 09:18.106
in the backyard

09:18.126 --> 09:19.726
of Marquis Changxing's Mansion.

09:22.126 --> 09:23.306
The informant

09:23.326 --> 09:24.386
said that her body

09:24.406 --> 09:26.156
was buried underground in the yard.

09:26.176 --> 09:27.086
Is that accurate?

09:27.086 --> 09:28.566
We can find out if it's accurate.

09:28.566 --> 09:29.526
- Wait.
- Mr. Zhen,

09:29.526 --> 09:31.866
are you still going to stop me?

09:31.886 --> 09:33.046
All the evidence is pointing

09:33.046 --> 09:34.786
to Marquis Changxing's Mansion.

09:34.806 --> 09:36.606
I know it's a tough case,

09:36.606 --> 09:38.126
so I need you

09:38.126 --> 09:39.626
to help me, Mr. Zhen.

09:39.646 --> 09:41.386
(White Tiger Bridge)
Throughout the country,

09:41.406 --> 09:43.126
everyone reveres you

09:43.126 --> 09:45.066
as the model for all civil officials,

09:45.086 --> 09:47.046
fearless of power and upright.

09:47.046 --> 09:49.506
If you hesitate now,

09:49.526 --> 09:51.966
who would step up to handle the case?

09:51.966 --> 09:53.346
As long as this case remains unsolved,

09:53.366 --> 09:54.526
all the women in the country

09:54.526 --> 09:55.846
will be at risk.

09:55.846 --> 09:57.446
We can't wait any longer, Mr. Zhen!

09:57.446 --> 09:59.046
Calm down, Mr. Yu.

10:00.166 --> 10:01.586
I just have one thing to ask.

10:01.606 --> 10:02.746
Go ahead.

10:02.766 --> 10:04.866
Marquis Changxing holds military power

10:04.886 --> 10:06.386
and commands the combat troops.

10:06.406 --> 10:07.366
When Nanwu invaded,

10:07.366 --> 10:08.786
he protected our country.

10:08.806 --> 10:10.766
Aren't you afraid of offending him?

10:10.766 --> 10:12.926
The law applies to everyone.

10:12.926 --> 10:13.886
What do I have to fear?

10:13.886 --> 10:14.866
Good!

10:14.886 --> 10:16.546
You truly have extraordinary courage.

10:16.566 --> 10:18.806
Finally, the Right Section got a capable man.

10:18.886 --> 10:21.206
Come on. I'll go with you.

10:47.846 --> 10:49.206
Miss.

10:49.926 --> 10:51.286
Miss.

10:53.126 --> 10:54.686
Is she dead?

10:57.766 --> 10:59.666
Miss. Miss!

10:59.686 --> 11:01.526
Don't hit me. Don't!

11:01.726 --> 11:04.046
(Miss Chi)
I'll behave.

11:04.166 --> 11:06.066
- Have you got the key?
- Yes.

11:06.086 --> 11:08.126
Don't be afraid.

11:08.166 --> 11:09.806
We're here to save you.

11:10.566 --> 11:14.606
I'll behave. I will.

11:21.886 --> 11:23.286
Fall in!

11:33.246 --> 11:35.026
Chief, Rapid Response Division all set.

11:35.046 --> 11:36.406
Let's set off.

11:51.126 --> 11:52.086
Set off!

11:52.086 --> 11:53.486
Yes!

11:59.806 --> 12:01.166
Er'niu!

12:02.706 --> 12:05.166
- Why haven't you done
- Master!

12:05.176 --> 12:06.046
Master.

12:06.046 --> 12:07.506
What I told you

12:07.526 --> 12:09.246
- to do?
- Master.

12:10.006 --> 12:11.106
Master,

12:11.126 --> 12:12.706
we've heard from the Capital Security

12:12.726 --> 12:13.886
that Yu Qi is coming

12:13.886 --> 12:15.686
to search our mansion with a team.

12:18.206 --> 12:19.566
What did you say?

12:19.926 --> 12:22.626
He's coming to search my mansion?

12:22.646 --> 12:23.606
What guts does this guy have

12:23.606 --> 12:25.766
to do such a thing?

12:25.966 --> 12:27.466
What is he searching for?

12:27.486 --> 12:29.046
He said he's looking for

12:29.046 --> 12:30.726
missing women.

12:35.526 --> 12:37.166
You wretch,

12:39.726 --> 12:41.886
what trouble have you made this time?

12:44.646 --> 12:46.086
Spit it out!

12:46.806 --> 12:50.646
He is a monster!

12:50.966 --> 12:52.326
Don't be afraid.

12:53.286 --> 12:56.046
I used to have a hard life.

12:56.126 --> 12:58.846
I thought he was Marquis Changxing's heir.

12:59.166 --> 13:00.306
Even without

13:00.326 --> 13:01.826
a formal status,

13:01.846 --> 13:03.726
I'd live a good life with him.

13:04.166 --> 13:05.526
Had I known...

13:05.646 --> 13:07.046
Had I known, I would never

13:07.046 --> 13:08.566
have followed him here.

13:08.566 --> 13:09.646
I should have jumped into a river.

13:09.646 --> 13:11.566
Keep it down, Miss.

13:11.606 --> 13:13.406
And saved myself

13:13.886 --> 13:16.526
all this torment.

13:16.526 --> 13:18.666
Miss, don't worry.

13:18.686 --> 13:20.106
I will help you.

13:20.126 --> 13:22.286
I'll get you out of this snake pit.

13:22.926 --> 13:24.826
- Really?
- By the heavens,

13:24.846 --> 13:26.026
I already

13:26.046 --> 13:27.786
took a huge risk to bring you here.

13:27.806 --> 13:29.106
Guards are everywhere outside.

13:29.126 --> 13:30.546
How can we help her?

13:30.566 --> 13:31.726
If they catch us,

13:31.726 --> 13:33.346
we're both dead meat!

13:33.366 --> 13:36.166
(Talents Galore on Blessed Land)

13:38.926 --> 13:41.326
(Marquis Changxing's Mansion)

13:43.486 --> 13:45.606
You've got

13:45.766 --> 13:47.686
a lot of nerve

13:48.006 --> 13:50.246
to barge into my mansion.

13:51.326 --> 13:52.606
I'll impeach you in front of His Majesty

13:52.606 --> 13:54.406
for disrespecting your superior

13:54.406 --> 13:55.986
and abusing power.

13:56.006 --> 13:58.646
Do whatever you like, sir.

13:58.686 --> 14:00.706
Even if you bring it to His Majesty,

14:00.726 --> 14:03.446
I have to act in accordance with the law.

14:04.286 --> 14:06.226
I command the Combat Troops.

14:06.246 --> 14:07.866
As a 1st Rank official,

14:07.886 --> 14:10.166
I hold the title of 1st Class Marquis.

14:10.206 --> 14:11.286
As a civilian official

14:11.286 --> 14:12.926
of Sub-4th Rank,

14:12.926 --> 14:14.386
aren't you offending

14:14.406 --> 14:15.966
your superior?

14:16.126 --> 14:17.246
The Capital Security

14:17.246 --> 14:18.926
oversees public security of Ling'an.

14:19.686 --> 14:21.466
Except for the Imperial Palace,

14:21.486 --> 14:22.886
all 14 streets

14:22.886 --> 14:24.006
and 108 blocks within the city

14:24.006 --> 14:26.446
are under our jurisdiction.

14:26.606 --> 14:27.966
Why?

14:28.086 --> 14:29.486
Sir,

14:29.806 --> 14:31.406
isn't your mansion

14:31.606 --> 14:33.526
under this jurisdiction?

14:33.886 --> 14:34.926
Mr. Zhen really

14:34.926 --> 14:36.946
has a way with words.

14:36.966 --> 14:38.566
Why else would I bring him here?

14:38.566 --> 14:41.306
You've got a ready tongue, Mr. Zhen.

14:41.326 --> 14:43.446
You have your hands in a lot of things.

14:43.806 --> 14:46.186
Even if I'm under your jurisdiction,

14:46.206 --> 14:48.006
you're being lawless

14:48.006 --> 14:49.966
and breaking into a civilian house.

14:51.646 --> 14:54.486
You really know how to adapt.

14:54.686 --> 14:57.046
One moment you're a 1st Rank official,

14:57.046 --> 14:59.846
and the next this is a civilian house.

15:00.046 --> 15:02.686
Since we're here to search,

15:03.806 --> 15:04.966
there must have been

15:04.966 --> 15:06.566
a murder here.

15:09.126 --> 15:11.386
This may be my fate.

15:11.406 --> 15:13.446
I don't want to drag anyone into this.

15:13.446 --> 15:14.626
Who said that?

15:14.646 --> 15:15.926
Were you born

15:15.926 --> 15:17.866
to be tortured by that villain?

15:17.886 --> 15:19.866
Miss, listen to me.

15:19.886 --> 15:21.326
The Capital Security will come

15:21.326 --> 15:22.566
to search the mansion today.

15:22.566 --> 15:24.286
By then, the backyard

15:24.286 --> 15:25.206
will attract the attention

15:25.206 --> 15:26.546
of the entire mansion.

15:26.566 --> 15:28.366
Even if there is noise in the western yard,

15:28.366 --> 15:30.286
no one will notice it.

15:30.366 --> 15:32.166
Fulu, take Miss Chi to the back door

15:32.166 --> 15:33.826
while things are in chaos.

15:33.846 --> 15:34.726
My maid Aman

15:34.726 --> 15:36.366
will meet you there.

15:37.086 --> 15:39.146
I don't think I can make it.

15:39.166 --> 15:40.526
Fulu, we're

15:40.526 --> 15:41.646
in the same boat now.

15:41.646 --> 15:42.926
You should give it a shot,

15:42.926 --> 15:44.166
try to live a new life,

15:44.166 --> 15:46.006
and get yourself a way out.

15:47.646 --> 15:49.206
Miss, look.

15:49.966 --> 15:51.766
You can crush this into powder.

15:51.766 --> 15:53.406
It'll make people sleepy.

15:53.726 --> 15:55.226
- You'll need it.
- Enough.

15:55.246 --> 15:56.506
We should go,

15:56.526 --> 15:58.346
or the guards will be suspicious.

15:58.366 --> 15:59.726
Miss,

15:59.766 --> 16:02.686
will the Capital Security really come?

16:03.006 --> 16:04.366
Sure.

16:05.526 --> 16:06.826
Miss,

16:06.846 --> 16:09.466
I can't thank you enough for your kindness.

16:09.486 --> 16:10.386
Remember,

16:10.406 --> 16:12.586
Heaven helps those who help themselves

16:12.606 --> 16:15.406
and abandons those who abandon themselves.

16:15.446 --> 16:16.806
Understand?

16:19.686 --> 16:21.046
- Let's go.
- Go.

16:31.406 --> 16:32.766
Sir,

16:33.406 --> 16:35.646
I've been investigating

16:35.646 --> 16:38.206
the case of the missing women in Ling'an.

16:38.326 --> 16:40.006
According to the witness,

16:40.006 --> 16:41.646
they all had contact with your son

16:41.646 --> 16:45.046
before they went missing.

16:45.686 --> 16:47.166
Witness?

16:47.606 --> 16:49.126
Which witness?

16:49.766 --> 16:50.686
Summon him forth

16:50.686 --> 16:52.906
to confront me face to face.

16:52.926 --> 16:54.986
I didn't realize you were here.

16:55.006 --> 16:57.306
If I summon him forth,

16:57.326 --> 16:58.566
are you going to threaten him

16:58.566 --> 17:00.846
with your coercive power?

17:02.286 --> 17:03.326
Can you

17:03.326 --> 17:05.266
accuse me of murder

17:05.286 --> 17:07.006
on the basis of a false tip?

17:07.886 --> 17:11.006
I didn't say you killed anyone.

17:13.126 --> 17:16.986
Are you confessing

17:17.006 --> 17:19.106
because you have a guilty conscience?

17:19.126 --> 17:20.566
Ridiculous.

17:21.486 --> 17:23.026
Do you have any evidence?

17:23.046 --> 17:24.746
If not,

17:24.766 --> 17:27.006
don't even think about stepping in here.

17:27.006 --> 17:28.446
Of course,

17:29.126 --> 17:31.046
we have evidence.

17:33.326 --> 17:37.046
This brass hairpin is the evidence.

17:38.246 --> 17:39.746
The witness also stated

17:39.766 --> 17:42.006
that you are bloodthirsty, cruel,

17:42.006 --> 17:43.446
and intolerable to the principles of heaven.

17:43.446 --> 17:45.166
You abused and killed several women,

17:45.166 --> 17:47.026
and hid their bodies

17:47.046 --> 17:49.626
in the backyard of the mansion.

17:49.646 --> 17:51.006
You are...

17:54.286 --> 17:56.886
As a reasonable man,

17:57.006 --> 18:00.086
I'll allow your search today.

18:00.246 --> 18:01.826
But let me be clear,

18:01.846 --> 18:04.126
if no body is found,

18:04.686 --> 18:06.106
I will

18:06.126 --> 18:09.006
by no means let this matter rest.

18:09.646 --> 18:11.006
Please.

18:11.886 --> 18:13.246
Search!

18:14.046 --> 18:16.606
(Marquis Changxing's Mansion)

18:31.886 --> 18:33.786
Why are there so many officers?

18:33.806 --> 18:35.606
What's going on?

19:01.526 --> 19:02.966
Mr. Zhen,

19:03.446 --> 19:05.206
why don't you have some tea?

19:35.606 --> 19:37.326
It doesn't feel right.

19:38.126 --> 19:39.226
Cao Xingyu surprisingly

19:39.246 --> 19:41.326
doesn't show the slightest hint of panic.

19:42.246 --> 19:45.046
Were the bodies moved last night?

19:45.926 --> 19:47.066
Last night?

19:47.086 --> 19:48.306
What happened last night?

19:48.326 --> 19:49.686
Nothing.

19:52.526 --> 19:54.646
Sir, there's something underneath!

19:55.526 --> 19:56.886
Hurry!

20:10.126 --> 20:12.386
I hear your wife was mad at you again?

20:12.406 --> 20:13.446
That's right.

20:13.446 --> 20:15.146
- I think if you
- It's a headache.

20:15.166 --> 20:16.626
buy her a flowery cloth off duty,

20:16.646 --> 20:18.566
- you'll be able to coax her.
- Good idea.

20:54.766 --> 20:57.046
Sir, it's a coffin!

20:58.086 --> 20:59.446
Open it!

21:02.566 --> 21:04.486
Guys, come on!

21:07.566 --> 21:09.966
Sir, the coffin...

21:19.846 --> 21:20.746
Chief,

21:20.766 --> 21:22.246
there are only books.

21:22.486 --> 21:23.826
Gentlemen,

21:23.846 --> 21:26.166
this is just the place

21:26.166 --> 21:28.246
where I bury the junk in my study.

21:28.726 --> 21:30.746
How could there be a body?

21:30.766 --> 21:31.926
Don't frame

21:31.926 --> 21:33.966
an innocent man like me.

21:38.766 --> 21:40.186
We were misinformed

21:40.206 --> 21:41.746
and offended you, sir.

21:41.766 --> 21:43.806
It doesn't matter, Mr. Zhen.

21:44.006 --> 21:45.946
I'm magnanimous enough

21:45.966 --> 21:47.766
to let this go.

21:53.966 --> 21:56.006
Does he let it go so easily?

21:56.086 --> 21:57.646
There must be something fishy.

21:57.646 --> 22:00.766
The bodies must be stashed in the mansion.

22:03.166 --> 22:04.866
I'm well aware,

22:04.886 --> 22:07.106
but we need proof.

22:07.126 --> 22:08.786
We've searched and found nothing.

22:08.806 --> 22:10.186
If we push further

22:10.206 --> 22:11.446
and he takes this to His Majesty,

22:11.446 --> 22:13.106
we're both guilty of breaking the law.

22:13.126 --> 22:15.426
Enough, let's call it a day.

22:15.426 --> 22:16.406
We need to plan this carefully.

22:16.406 --> 22:17.886
Are you kidding me?

22:18.086 --> 22:19.126
If we leave now,

22:19.126 --> 22:20.926
we won't get a second chance.

22:22.006 --> 22:23.026
If we have to break the law,

22:23.046 --> 22:24.406
I'll take the blame.

22:24.486 --> 22:25.886
Long Dan, keep searching!

22:25.886 --> 22:27.246
Yes.

22:27.446 --> 22:28.806
Er'niu.

22:35.686 --> 22:38.226
Mr. Zhen, don't go too far.

22:38.246 --> 22:39.486
I can't stand you

22:39.486 --> 22:40.906
fooling around in my mansion!

22:40.926 --> 22:42.826
Someone, walk them out!

22:42.846 --> 22:44.166
Don't obstruct our official duties.

22:44.166 --> 22:45.506
Yu Qi,

22:45.526 --> 22:46.806
rein in your impertinence.

22:46.806 --> 22:47.746
Sir,

22:47.766 --> 22:50.046
if your son is innocent,

22:50.366 --> 22:53.026
why are you afraid of a dog?

22:53.046 --> 22:54.346
Ridiculous.

22:54.366 --> 22:56.046
How could I be afraid of a dog?

22:56.046 --> 22:57.406
Release the dog!

22:58.926 --> 23:00.286
Go!

23:02.366 --> 23:03.286
What are you waiting for?

23:03.286 --> 23:04.646
Stop them!

23:22.286 --> 23:23.646
Xingyu!

23:24.646 --> 23:25.626
Yu Qi,

23:25.646 --> 23:27.086
don't be reckless.

23:42.726 --> 23:44.446
- Move it.
- Yes.

23:49.766 --> 23:51.446
- Watch it.
- Yes.

23:53.086 --> 23:54.426
Chief!

23:54.446 --> 23:56.366
Chief, we've found the bodies.

24:17.406 --> 24:19.046
Bodies! Bodies!

24:19.046 --> 24:20.406
They all match.

24:21.326 --> 24:23.266
Take Cao Xingyu, the suspect,

24:23.286 --> 24:25.046
back to the Capital Security Office.

24:25.046 --> 24:26.646
- Yes.
- Wait.

24:27.006 --> 24:28.926
I didn't kill them.

24:29.806 --> 24:31.166
He did.

24:32.086 --> 24:33.226
Come out.

24:33.246 --> 24:34.606
Come out.

24:35.566 --> 24:37.206
Anzi.

24:40.326 --> 24:41.686
Come out!

24:44.166 --> 24:45.206
Does he think

24:45.206 --> 24:48.086
we look like idiots?

24:48.326 --> 24:50.226
He's trying to pin the blame on a servant.

24:50.246 --> 24:51.986
How can you say

24:52.006 --> 24:53.686
I killed these women?

24:54.766 --> 24:55.806
Just on the basis of a tip

24:55.806 --> 24:58.046
you don't know if it's true?

25:00.206 --> 25:01.926
Let me ask you,

25:02.446 --> 25:04.086
what's your name?

25:04.726 --> 25:06.486
My name is Anzi.

25:06.726 --> 25:08.646
Your master said

25:08.686 --> 25:11.726
you killed all these women?

25:13.486 --> 25:14.846
I...

25:16.326 --> 25:18.286
Confess to it.

25:18.566 --> 25:21.846
We've treated you well.

25:21.886 --> 25:24.146
We've arranged your marriage

25:24.166 --> 25:25.726
and secured your lineage.

25:25.926 --> 25:27.366
Cao Xingyu,

25:28.886 --> 25:30.886
stop threatening him.

25:31.846 --> 25:34.486
Anzi, don't be afraid.

25:34.526 --> 25:36.286
Tell us everything.

25:36.726 --> 25:39.016
This case spans too wide to ignore.

25:39.036 --> 25:40.806
I can report it directly to His Majesty.

25:41.646 --> 25:43.966
No matter their rank,

25:44.086 --> 25:46.346
they dare not touch your family.

25:46.366 --> 25:47.726
Trust me.

25:51.486 --> 25:54.446
Anzi, look at me.

25:55.446 --> 25:57.966
Your family has been our servants

25:58.166 --> 26:00.726
for three generations.

26:01.326 --> 26:03.126
You know

26:03.366 --> 26:05.186
my character and strength.

26:05.206 --> 26:07.646
If you confess to your crime,

26:07.726 --> 26:09.226
I can guarantee

26:09.246 --> 26:11.286
that your family won't be implicated.

26:11.566 --> 26:12.926
Understand?

26:21.046 --> 26:22.406
Yes.

26:23.046 --> 26:24.606
I killed them.

26:25.526 --> 26:27.526
I killed them all.

26:28.366 --> 26:30.166
Have you thought it through?

26:30.606 --> 26:32.326
If you confess to it,

26:32.326 --> 26:33.726
it won't be easy

26:33.726 --> 26:35.486
to go back on your word later.

26:36.086 --> 26:38.086
I'm the murderer.

26:39.566 --> 26:40.886
I was blinded by lust

26:40.886 --> 26:41.846
and gave in to my desires.

26:41.846 --> 26:44.406
I killed those girls with my own hands

26:44.606 --> 26:47.146
and threw their bodies into the dry well.

26:47.166 --> 26:49.526
It has nothing to do

26:49.846 --> 26:51.646
with Young Master.

26:57.206 --> 26:58.146
Master,

26:58.166 --> 26:59.906
I beg you to treat my family kindly.

26:59.926 --> 27:00.866
Master!

27:00.886 --> 27:03.126
I'm glad

27:03.206 --> 27:05.106
you admitted your guilt.

27:05.126 --> 27:06.346
Don't worry.

27:06.366 --> 27:09.006
I will treat your family well.

27:14.846 --> 27:15.906
Marquis Changxing,

27:15.926 --> 27:17.946
you dare to silence him in public.

27:17.966 --> 27:19.626
You have no regard for the law!

27:19.646 --> 27:22.646
I've always managed my family like an army.

27:22.846 --> 27:24.006
Now that

27:24.006 --> 27:25.966
a wicked servant

27:25.966 --> 27:27.986
tarnished Marquis Changxing's reputation,

27:28.006 --> 27:29.366
isn't it better for me

27:29.366 --> 27:30.326
to execute him

27:30.326 --> 27:31.386
on your behalf?

27:31.406 --> 27:33.606
It saves you the trouble of holding a trial.

27:33.606 --> 27:35.206
According to the law of Dazhou,

27:36.206 --> 27:37.846
killing a servant is a crime.

27:37.846 --> 27:39.246
Mr. Zhen,

27:40.566 --> 27:41.446
don't think

27:41.446 --> 27:43.566
you're the only one who knows the law.

27:43.806 --> 27:46.306
Killing a servant for no reason is a crime.

27:46.326 --> 27:48.146
But he committed a capital offense.

27:48.166 --> 27:49.646
What's wrong with my father killing him?

27:49.646 --> 27:51.606
Even if he committed a capital offense,

27:51.846 --> 27:53.786
you should have reported to the authorities

27:53.806 --> 27:55.526
for approval before executing him.

27:55.526 --> 27:56.726
He was just a lowly servant.

27:56.726 --> 27:58.666
I could kill him if I wanted to.

27:58.686 --> 27:59.566
It's not your turn

27:59.566 --> 28:01.466
to approve it.

28:01.486 --> 28:03.146
If you act without official approval,

28:03.166 --> 28:04.426
it's a legal violation.

28:04.426 --> 28:05.406
According to the law of Dazhou,

28:05.406 --> 28:08.006
unauthorized execution of a servant

28:08.966 --> 28:10.766
warrants 100 floggings.

28:15.046 --> 28:17.346
What, Mr. Zhen,

28:17.366 --> 28:20.446
are you going to flog me?

28:20.686 --> 28:21.826
Dare you?

28:21.846 --> 28:23.966
You, I!

28:26.926 --> 28:29.126
I'm sorry to bother you.

28:29.166 --> 28:31.566
Do as you please, sir.

28:33.046 --> 28:35.206
Suit yourselves.

28:35.526 --> 28:37.356
I have military affairs to attend to

28:37.376 --> 28:38.766
and don't have the mood

28:38.766 --> 28:41.006
to waste time with you.

28:56.926 --> 28:58.226
Stop looking.

28:58.246 --> 28:59.606
Go back.

29:01.326 --> 29:03.186
Why did you stop me?

29:03.206 --> 29:04.566
Are you going to let them go?

29:04.566 --> 29:05.646
We're here not to prosecute Cao Yong

29:05.646 --> 29:07.846
for killing his servant,

29:07.846 --> 29:09.606
but to find these bodies.

29:09.606 --> 29:11.206
The bodies are all here,

29:11.206 --> 29:12.746
not a single one missing.

29:12.766 --> 29:14.406
But the evidence died with them.

29:14.406 --> 29:16.686
I won't let that happen.

29:18.566 --> 29:19.926
Who's been getting to you?

29:19.926 --> 29:20.846
You're all jittery

29:20.846 --> 29:22.526
out of nowhere.

29:22.886 --> 29:24.486
You are rather young.

29:24.686 --> 29:26.986
Does it have anything to do

29:27.006 --> 29:28.846
with being young?

29:33.926 --> 29:35.606
The servant

29:35.646 --> 29:37.546
didn't kill the girls.

29:37.566 --> 29:39.186
He didn't have the guts.

29:39.206 --> 29:40.726
Was it Qian?

29:40.806 --> 29:42.786
No, Cao Xingyu killed them.

29:42.806 --> 29:44.126
You're not too stupid.

29:44.126 --> 29:45.806
Did you know it all along?

29:45.846 --> 29:47.046
Why didn't you warn me?

29:47.046 --> 29:48.036
How could I warn you?

29:48.036 --> 29:49.166
You kept calling him brother-in-law

29:49.166 --> 29:50.406
intimately.

29:50.406 --> 29:52.186
Would you listen if I warned you?

29:52.206 --> 29:53.566
Cao Xingyu was so cruel

29:53.566 --> 29:55.246
and killed so many people.

29:55.926 --> 29:57.986
Does Qian know about this?

29:58.006 --> 29:59.706
She knows too?

29:59.726 --> 30:01.626
Why did she still invite us over?

30:01.646 --> 30:03.346
How could she do this to me?

30:03.366 --> 30:04.906
Though we weren't born of the same mother,

30:04.926 --> 30:06.806
I'm the closest to her.

30:09.126 --> 30:10.846
Who told you to let Jiang Si go?

30:16.006 --> 30:18.166
After seeing so many dead women,

30:18.966 --> 30:20.366
they were so scared that they asked

30:20.366 --> 30:22.206
the Capital Security to take them out.

30:22.446 --> 30:24.766
How could I stop them?

30:25.886 --> 30:28.886
How dare you talk back to me, wench!

30:29.006 --> 30:32.046
How dare you?

30:32.326 --> 30:33.506
If my mother

30:33.526 --> 30:35.506
weren't happy with you,

30:35.526 --> 30:36.716
I'd kill you

30:36.736 --> 30:37.606
like I killed

30:37.606 --> 30:38.586
those filthy women.

30:38.606 --> 30:40.666
Worthless wench!

30:40.686 --> 30:41.986
Young Master.

30:42.006 --> 30:43.346
Young Master,

30:43.366 --> 30:44.826
for your mother's sake...

30:44.846 --> 30:46.206
Go!

30:48.806 --> 30:51.126
Hit me! Kill me!

30:51.326 --> 30:53.386
Besides hitting and killing women,

30:53.406 --> 30:55.686
what else do you have the guts to do?

30:55.846 --> 30:58.386
Your dad hit you, so you take it out on me.

30:58.406 --> 30:59.286
If you're so tough,

30:59.286 --> 31:00.126
why don't you dare

31:00.126 --> 31:02.406
make a peep in front of him?

31:11.646 --> 31:14.146
As a lowly woman from a humble family,

31:14.166 --> 31:16.246
how dare you look down on me?

31:16.286 --> 31:18.866
Where's the eagerness you had when you

31:18.886 --> 31:21.046
took your cousin's place to marry me?

31:22.286 --> 31:24.086
You brought this

31:24.686 --> 31:26.886
on yourself.

31:36.926 --> 31:38.286
Yes,

31:38.806 --> 31:40.446
I did it.

31:40.686 --> 31:42.246
I deserve it.

31:42.526 --> 31:44.646
Go ahead, kill me!

31:45.566 --> 31:46.966
Give the Capital Security

31:46.966 --> 31:48.526
another body to handle.

31:49.566 --> 31:50.886
Let's see if you'll find another Anzi

31:50.886 --> 31:52.766
to pin it on.

32:16.126 --> 32:18.406
I'll kill you!

32:29.486 --> 32:31.686
I will kill you!

32:54.606 --> 32:56.806
I'll spare you today.

32:57.446 --> 32:59.566
When things calm down,

33:00.246 --> 33:02.206
I'll come back for your cheap life.

33:08.206 --> 33:09.606
Ma'am.

33:10.086 --> 33:11.446
Ma'am.

33:11.486 --> 33:12.886
Ma'am,

33:13.926 --> 33:15.686
are you alright?

33:19.766 --> 33:21.126
Cui'er,

33:24.046 --> 33:25.926
I don't want

33:27.966 --> 33:31.286
to spend another day like this.

33:35.206 --> 33:36.566
Ma'am,

33:36.646 --> 33:38.166
let's run away.

33:40.006 --> 33:41.366
Run?

33:44.486 --> 33:46.326
Where to?

33:49.206 --> 33:51.386
When Miss Si left, she told me

33:51.406 --> 33:53.126
she left a small palanquin

33:53.126 --> 33:54.706
in the alley at the back door

33:54.726 --> 33:56.766
in case you want to go home.

33:57.006 --> 33:58.786
If you don't go,

33:58.806 --> 34:01.206
I'm afraid you'll die.

34:13.766 --> 34:15.126
Ma'am.

34:15.166 --> 34:17.526
I can't just sit around waiting to die.

34:19.686 --> 34:21.046
Go home.

34:23.166 --> 34:24.926
Let's go home.

34:27.926 --> 34:29.366
Go home.

34:38.486 --> 34:41.286
(Morning Drizzle)

34:41.286 --> 34:42.626
(Haitang Chamber)

34:42.646 --> 34:43.946
Heaven must be blind

34:43.966 --> 34:44.926
to let that murderous demon

34:44.926 --> 34:46.566
walk free.

34:48.046 --> 34:49.046
Commandant Yu

34:49.046 --> 34:50.346
vowed to keep digging,

34:50.366 --> 34:52.746
but it's a dead end with the witnesses dead.

34:52.766 --> 34:54.346
I don't think so.

34:54.366 --> 34:55.986
Have you forgotten Miss Chi?

34:56.006 --> 34:57.886
She was so grateful when you asked me

34:57.886 --> 34:59.106
to send her out of town.

34:59.126 --> 35:00.526
Just say the word,

35:00.526 --> 35:02.326
and she'll come testify.

35:03.766 --> 35:05.466
But her life has been so hard,

35:05.486 --> 35:07.106
and she barely managed to escape.

35:07.126 --> 35:08.046
If I ask her

35:08.046 --> 35:09.466
to identify Cao Xingyu,

35:09.486 --> 35:11.126
her days of detention

35:11.126 --> 35:12.626
will become public.

35:12.646 --> 35:13.686
How can a young woman

35:13.686 --> 35:15.346
survive such a thing?

35:15.366 --> 35:16.446
Wouldn't that

35:16.446 --> 35:17.906
push her back to the edge?

35:17.926 --> 35:19.486
If she doesn't testify,

35:19.486 --> 35:20.886
the criminal will walk free.

35:20.886 --> 35:22.886
Do you think she can live in peace?

35:23.486 --> 35:25.446
I'll visit her tomorrow.

35:26.566 --> 35:28.206
Si.

35:28.646 --> 35:30.126
- Si.
- At this hour?

35:30.126 --> 35:31.446
Is she here to make trouble?

35:31.446 --> 35:32.806
Go and take a look.

35:35.326 --> 35:37.486
Miss Pei, what are you doing?

35:38.646 --> 35:40.246
- Si.
- What's up?

35:40.246 --> 35:41.606
Qian,

35:41.686 --> 35:42.686
Jiang Qian is home.

35:42.686 --> 35:44.366
She's at Grandma's now.

35:45.886 --> 35:48.126
(Cixin Hall)

35:51.206 --> 35:52.206
Qian,

35:52.206 --> 35:54.686
stop crying.

35:55.166 --> 35:56.246
You need to tell Grandma

35:56.246 --> 35:57.886
why you ran back home

35:57.886 --> 35:59.666
in the middle of the night?

35:59.686 --> 36:01.146
Rumors say there was a murder

36:01.166 --> 36:03.446
at Marquis Changxing's Mansion.

36:03.446 --> 36:05.006
Several people died.

36:05.006 --> 36:06.806
That's a murder case!

36:06.806 --> 36:08.246
Has your husband been implicated?

36:08.246 --> 36:10.326
Did something happen to him?

36:10.326 --> 36:13.006
With a father who rules the roost,

36:13.366 --> 36:15.486
what's a murder case to him?

36:15.606 --> 36:17.426
Whatever the mess, his father will fix it.

36:17.446 --> 36:19.466
I'm not criticizing you,

36:19.486 --> 36:21.626
but you're husband and wife.

36:21.646 --> 36:23.666
You should share honor and disgrace.

36:23.686 --> 36:26.146
Running back whenever you have a problem

36:26.166 --> 36:27.166
isn't good.

36:27.166 --> 36:29.066
Tell Mother what's wrong.

36:29.086 --> 36:31.106
Did you have a fight with your husband

36:31.126 --> 36:33.466
or did he bully you?

36:33.486 --> 36:34.566
Physical fights

36:34.566 --> 36:37.246
between couples are common.

36:37.246 --> 36:38.546
Ask your mother.

36:38.566 --> 36:40.186
Now that you're married,

36:40.206 --> 36:42.846
you can't be so headstrong.

36:43.206 --> 36:44.486
It's late tonight.

36:44.486 --> 36:45.706
You can stay here.

36:45.726 --> 36:47.566
Go home and apologize

36:47.566 --> 36:49.086
to your husband's family tomorrow morning.

36:49.086 --> 36:51.726
Tell them that Grandma was sick

36:51.726 --> 36:53.646
and called you back tonight.

36:54.206 --> 36:55.226
Qian,

36:55.246 --> 36:56.686
now that you've made it back,

36:56.686 --> 36:58.126
you should tell them everything.

36:58.126 --> 36:59.326
Yes, Qian.

36:59.326 --> 37:00.246
You knew that mansion

37:00.246 --> 37:01.326
was a den of wolves,

37:01.326 --> 37:03.166
yet you dragged your sisters into its jaws.

37:03.166 --> 37:04.546
What's your scheme?

37:04.566 --> 37:05.886
With Grandma here,

37:05.886 --> 37:07.166
lay it all out now.

37:07.166 --> 37:08.006
Shut your mouth!

37:08.006 --> 37:09.626
Den of wolves?

37:09.646 --> 37:10.906
Who gave you the right to speak?

37:10.926 --> 37:13.006
Qiao, tell Grandma

37:13.006 --> 37:14.546
what's going on.

37:14.566 --> 37:15.946
It's Cao Xingyu.

37:15.966 --> 37:18.186
He harbors ill intentions toward Si.

37:18.206 --> 37:19.226
What?

37:19.246 --> 37:22.546
He harbors ill intentions toward Si?

37:22.566 --> 37:23.826
What...

37:23.846 --> 37:26.386
What an enormous joke!

37:26.406 --> 37:27.566
What kind of girl

37:27.566 --> 37:28.546
hasn't he seen?

37:28.566 --> 37:29.806
You, you, and you,

37:29.806 --> 37:31.066
go back now.

37:31.086 --> 37:33.326
Mrs. Li, take them back to their rooms.

37:33.686 --> 37:36.126
Ladies, please return.

37:41.686 --> 37:44.206
Qian, stop crying.

37:44.206 --> 37:46.766
Were you kept in the dark,

37:46.766 --> 37:49.726
so you ran back in anger?

37:50.246 --> 37:51.866
I know everything.

37:51.886 --> 37:53.746
What are you talking about?

37:53.766 --> 37:55.726
What do you mean?

38:01.686 --> 38:03.046
This...

38:08.406 --> 38:09.766
My goodness!

38:09.846 --> 38:12.926
Qian, did he hit you?

38:12.926 --> 38:15.446
He hit you so hard.

38:15.446 --> 38:18.286
Why didn't you tell us earlier?

38:18.286 --> 38:19.806
Tell you?

38:21.046 --> 38:23.086
How could I?

38:23.646 --> 38:25.866
Mother taught me since childhood

38:25.886 --> 38:27.886
and Grandma reminded me day and night

38:28.076 --> 38:29.046
that I'm the finest young lady

38:29.046 --> 38:30.846
in this family.

38:31.806 --> 38:33.366
Our family's fate

38:33.366 --> 38:35.286
rests entirely on me.

38:35.606 --> 38:38.946
I've been studying the four arts

38:38.966 --> 38:40.746
and household management since young,

38:40.766 --> 38:42.686
never slacking for a moment,

38:43.686 --> 38:46.166
all to marry into a marquis's family

38:46.486 --> 38:47.526
and secure a prosperous future

38:47.526 --> 38:49.386
for myself and our family.

38:49.406 --> 38:50.746
But what happened?

38:50.766 --> 38:51.606
I did everything

38:51.606 --> 38:53.266
you said.

38:53.286 --> 38:54.286
Why have I ended up

38:54.286 --> 38:55.526
in this situation?

38:55.526 --> 38:58.086
What did I do wrong?

39:01.246 --> 39:04.526
Four years,

39:04.926 --> 39:06.106
two months,

39:06.126 --> 39:07.806
and seven days married to Cao Xingyu,

39:08.846 --> 39:11.566
every day a living hell.

39:12.486 --> 39:13.926
Fists,

39:14.206 --> 39:15.546
slaps,

39:15.566 --> 39:16.926
whips,

39:17.326 --> 39:19.366
I've tasted them all.

39:19.886 --> 39:21.286
I begged him,

39:21.646 --> 39:23.006
but it was useless.

39:23.486 --> 39:25.406
Then, I tried to fight back,

39:26.446 --> 39:28.846
but that only made him beat me harder.

39:31.646 --> 39:33.326
After enough beatings,

39:34.406 --> 39:35.446
I learned

39:35.446 --> 39:36.806
the most useful trick.

39:37.166 --> 39:39.146
I would play dead

39:39.166 --> 39:40.046
and let him hit a corpse

39:40.046 --> 39:41.926
that gave him nothing.

39:42.886 --> 39:44.326
The more numb I was,

39:44.526 --> 39:46.366
the faster he got bored.

39:46.806 --> 39:48.406
Soon enough,

39:48.726 --> 39:51.086
he would move on to some new fun.

40:00.086 --> 40:01.446
Qian.

40:02.126 --> 40:03.266
Qian, don't be afraid.

40:03.286 --> 40:06.106
Mother will take you back now

40:06.126 --> 40:07.246
to seek a divorce from him.

40:07.246 --> 40:08.606
Nonsense!

40:09.006 --> 40:09.926
If I hadn't come,

40:09.926 --> 40:11.786
you would've turned the place upside down.

40:11.806 --> 40:13.146
Mother,

40:13.166 --> 40:14.606
why didn't you stop them?

40:14.606 --> 40:16.426
How could you let them do this?

40:16.446 --> 40:17.566
Look how

40:17.566 --> 40:19.366
she's been beaten!

40:19.526 --> 40:21.406
Darling, you're finally back.

40:21.406 --> 40:24.766
Take a look at our daughter!

40:25.006 --> 40:25.966
There are bruises

40:25.966 --> 40:28.326
all over her body.

40:28.326 --> 40:30.806
Isn't there justice under the sky?

40:30.806 --> 40:31.786
Tomorrow morning,

40:31.806 --> 40:34.006
we'll go to Marquis Changxing's Mansion

40:34.006 --> 40:35.926
to divorce him!

40:37.966 --> 40:40.086
They really have no regard for the law.

40:40.126 --> 40:41.766
Tomorrow, I'll go to Marquis Changxing

40:41.766 --> 40:42.986
to demand an explanation.

40:43.006 --> 40:43.966
I'll ask him

40:43.966 --> 40:45.346
why his good-for-nothing son

40:45.366 --> 40:46.966
bullied my Qian

40:46.966 --> 40:48.186
like this.

40:48.206 --> 40:49.586
Son, you're right.

40:49.606 --> 40:50.606
They can't

40:50.606 --> 40:53.206
bully Qian anymore.

40:53.686 --> 40:56.646
We have to handle this properly

40:57.326 --> 41:00.406
as it concerns our relationship.

41:02.286 --> 41:03.506
Mother,

41:03.526 --> 41:04.886
I see.

41:11.406 --> 41:12.246
Look,

41:12.246 --> 41:14.446
what's the point of telling you?

41:16.406 --> 41:17.766
Father,

41:21.366 --> 41:22.446
why do you think Cao Xingyu

41:22.446 --> 41:24.806
dares act so brazenly?

41:26.886 --> 41:28.086
Simply because he knows

41:28.086 --> 41:29.946
I've got no family to back me up.

41:29.966 --> 41:32.046
Even after such a beating,

41:32.246 --> 41:34.566
all you will do is give him

41:34.886 --> 41:36.926
a half-hearted scolding!

41:36.926 --> 41:38.266
Qian,

41:38.286 --> 41:41.086
how can you say that?

41:41.726 --> 41:42.646
Aren't we going to

41:42.646 --> 41:43.846
ask for an explanation?

41:43.846 --> 41:45.286
So what?

41:48.326 --> 41:51.246
He is Marquis Changxing

41:51.486 --> 41:53.426
who holds untouchable power.

41:53.446 --> 41:56.846
We are no match for them.

41:57.126 --> 42:01.226
We can only ask for an explanation now.

42:01.246 --> 42:02.446
So you'll

42:02.446 --> 42:04.126
trade my scars

42:04.246 --> 42:06.766
for your and my brother's gain?

42:08.846 --> 42:10.206
- Ungrateful daughter!
- You...

42:10.206 --> 42:11.526
Rebellious and disrespectful!

42:11.526 --> 42:12.766
What are you doing?

42:12.766 --> 42:14.786
She has been beaten up so hard.

42:14.806 --> 42:17.486
Do you still want to beat her?

42:28.966 --> 42:30.686
Since ancient times,

42:31.326 --> 42:33.606
a daughter must obey her father at home

42:34.846 --> 42:36.646
and her husband after marriage.

42:42.766 --> 42:44.126
Mother,

42:44.606 --> 42:47.046
I won't let her divorce him.

42:47.606 --> 42:48.966
Don't worry.

42:49.046 --> 42:53.406
(The End of Episode 5)

42:53.856 --> 42:55.586
♪ From place to place ♪

42:55.586 --> 43:00.526
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:00.896 --> 43:03.276
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:03.276 --> 43:07.506
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:08.216 --> 43:10.616
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:10.636 --> 43:14.296
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:14.316 --> 43:17.736
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:17.886 --> 43:23.406
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:24.226 --> 43:27.906
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:27.906 --> 43:31.986
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:32.226 --> 43:33.966
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:33.986 --> 43:38.686
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:38.686 --> 43:42.256
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:42.276 --> 43:46.506
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:46.526 --> 43:48.306
♪ Time glows ♪

43:48.306 --> 43:52.846
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:52.866 --> 43:57.666
♪ And stars ♪

44:01.896 --> 44:04.426
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:04.446 --> 44:08.066
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:08.086 --> 44:11.516
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:11.536 --> 44:16.156
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:16.156 --> 44:19.846
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:19.866 --> 44:23.956
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:24.066 --> 44:25.886
♪ Time glows ♪

44:25.886 --> 44:30.436
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:30.456 --> 44:34.156
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:34.176 --> 44:38.336
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:38.516 --> 44:40.276
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:40.276 --> 44:44.796
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:44.796 --> 44:48.436
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:48.456 --> 44:54.126
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:55.816 --> 44:57.746
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:57.746 --> 45:05.246
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
